# VHS tape — https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Record: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "go run ./cmd/troopa"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "n"
Sleep 500ms
Type "demo"
Sleep 400ms
Escape
Sleep 400ms
Ctrl+K
Sleep 800ms
Type "tema"
Sleep 600ms
Escape
Sleep 400ms
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
